  "pseudocode": "1. stack = []\n2. seen = Set()\n3. last_occurrence = Map of char to index\n4. for i, char in s:\n5.   if char not in seen:\n6.     while stack and char < stack.top and i < last_occurrence[stack.top]:\n7.       seen.remove(stack.pop())\n8.     stack.push(char)\n9.     seen.add(char)",
